   \[ \text{Rate} = -\frac{1}{k} \frac{dm(\text{NH}_4CNO)}{dt} \]  
   Since the reaction is first-order, the rate of formation of urea is proportional to the concentration of \( NH_4CNO \):  
   \[ \text{Rate} = k [NH_4CNO] \]  
