   - **Rotation axes (Cn)**: Rotations by 1/n of the 2π angle (e.g., C1, C2, C3, C4, C5, C6).
   - **Rotation-rotation axes (Cn')**: Rotation axes with a mirror plane perpendicular to the axis.
