The central angle \( \theta \) of the unrolled disk is:
\[
\theta = \frac{2\pi r}{\ell r} \times 360^\circ = \frac{2\pi r}{\pi \ell} \times 360^\circ = \frac{2\pi r}{\pi \ell} = \frac{2\pi \times \frac{3}{8}}{2\pi} = \frac{3}{8}.
\]
