\[
\theta = \frac{2\pi r}{2\pi \ell} \times 360^\circ = \frac{r}{\ell} \times 360^\circ = \frac{3/8}{1} \times 360^\circ = \frac{3}{8} \times 360^\circ = 135^\circ.
\]

