\]

The lateral surface area of the cone is equal to the area of the sector of the circle with radius \( \ell \). The circumference of the circle is \( 2\pi \ell = 2\pi \times 1 = 2\pi \). The circumference of the base of the cone is \( 2\pi r = 2\pi \times \frac{3}{8} = \frac{3}{4}\pi \). 

