- \( T_{\text{water}} = 220 \, \text{°C} = 493 \, \text{K} \)
- \( c_{\text{gas}} = 1.005 \, \text{kJ/kgK} \)
- \( L_{\text{water}} = 1858.5 \, \text{kJ/kg} \)
- \( m_{\text{water}} = 1 \, \text{kg} \)

