   \]

3. **Apply momentum conservation**:
   The net force on the collar equals the net momentum flux:
   \[
   F = \dot{m} \dot{v}
   \]
   Substituting the values:
   \[
   F = 0.3 \, \text{kg/s} \times 5.16 \, \text{m/s} = 1.55 \, \text{N}
   \]
